
(
-----------------------------------------------------------
Creating a dictionary with the Pin operations, in order to 
assign meaningful names without prefix Pin.xxx or similar
-----------------------------------------------------------
)

CDict Pin

(
Using the "sys.pin" single op for all things
single pin related
)

: .setOut (pin) 1 sys.pin ;
: .setIn  (pin) 2 sys.pin ;
: .readDigital (pin -- value) 3 sys.pin ;
: .readAnalog (pin -- value) 4 sys.pin ;
: .writeDigital (value pin -- ) 5 sys.pin ;
: .writeAnalog  (value pin -- ) 6 sys.pin ;

CDictEnd


